{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01821","headline":"杂曲歌辞 古离别 · 王适","name":"杂曲歌辞 古离别","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔岁惊杨柳，高楼悲独守。\n今年芳树枝，孤栖怨别离。\n珠帘昼不卷，罗幔晓长垂。\n苦调琴先觉，愁容镜独知。\n频来鴈度无消息，罢去鸳文何用织。\n夜还罗帐空有情，春着帬腰自无力。\n青轩桃李落纷纷，紫庭兰蕙日氛氲。\n已能顦顇今如此，更复含情一待君。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01821.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01821","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}